    "chunk_text": "drincan on Eft do \u00fe\u00e6t sylfe wi\u00f0 utsiht & wi\u00f0 wyrmas on inno\u00f0e & wi\u00f0 swi\u00f0licne cyle. Hyt frema\u00f0. Ellen. Wi\u00f0 w\u00e6terseocnysse genim \u00feas wyrte \u00fee man samsuchon & o\u00f0rum naman ellen hate\u00fe, syle drincan Heo gehn\u00e6ce\u00fe \u00f0a anginnu \u00feam w\u00e6terseocum. Eac swylce heo frema\u00fe wi\u00f0 \u00fea unmihticnysse \u00fe\u00e6s mig\u00f0an & wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra inno\u00f0a astyrunga. Wi\u00f0 springas & wi\u00f0 toborsten lic genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte leaf samsuchon gedrigede & gecnucude Hyt sceal berstan & halian. Wi\u00f0 scorpiones stincg genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte & sealt & eced, cnuca tosomne & to plastre gewyrc, He bi\u00f0 geh\u00e6led. Wi\u00f0 micele h\u00e6tan & wi\u00f0 geswel \u00f0\u00e6ra eagena genim \u00f0as sylfan wyrte mid meluwe gemencgede & to Hit bi\u00f0 geli\u00feigad. \u00deeos wyrt \u00f0e man stecas & o\u00ferum naman nemne\u00fe h\u00e6f\u00f0 s\u00e6d mycel, & \u00fe\u00e6t ys sm\u00e6l & gehw\u00e6de, & Genim \u00feas wyrte gesodene, syle drincan. Heo \u00fe\u00e6ra breosta sar geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Eac hyt is gewunelic \u00fe\u00e6t hy man to manegum godum drenceon gemencge . \u00d0eos wyrte \u00f0e man thyaspis & o\u00ferum naman nemne\u00fe hafa\u00fe sm\u00e6le leaf on fingres lencge & Eal \u00f0eos wyrt is strangre gecynde & bitterre. \u00d0ysse wyrte wos wel gewrungen & an scenc ful gedruncen, ealle \u00fea bitern",
